Rockchip secure boot signing

Files: dev.key, dev.crt and dev.pubkey.

Generate an RSA-2048 key, certificate and public key:
  openssl genrsa -out dev.key 2048
  openssl req -new -x509 -key dev.key -out dev.crt \
    -days 3650 -subj "/CN=NAOS Secure Boot"
  openssl rsa -in dev.key -pubout -out dev.pubkey

Devices with a programmed OTP public-key hash require the matching existing key.
